OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FFinal training is underway to ready
OL,7,Fthe crew of the first new Mersey Ferry
OL,8,Ffor more than 60 years.
OL,10,FThe Royal Daffodil is the first of the
OL,11,Fworld-famous ferries ever to be built
OL,12,Fwith the leisure market in mind and is
OL,13,Fsaid to be bigger and greener than its
OL,14,Fpredecessors.
OL,16,FWhilst an exact date hasn't been set
OL,17,Ffor the #26m diesel-electric vessel
OL,18,Fentering service, passengers journeys
OL,19,Fare expected to begin soon.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
