PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FMeanwhile, captains, engineers,
OL,7,Fdeckhands and customer service staff
OL,8,Fhave been learning new systems and
OL,9,Fmastering new technology.
OL,11,FLiverpudlian captain Gary Simpson
OL,12,Fsaid, "The difference between Royal
OL,13,FDaffodil and the vessels we've
OL,14,Foperated before is night and day. The
OL,15,Fpropulsion system is completely
OL,16,Fdifferent, and the learning curve has
OL,17,Fbeen huge.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,F"I was the last captain of Royal Iris
OL,7,Fpassenger service, so saying goodbye
OL,8,Fwas emotional because she meant a lot
OL,9,Fto so many people. But looking at what
OL,10,Fwe've got now, Royal Daffodil is an
OL,11,Fabsolute game changer."
OL,13,FWhile passengers are expected to
OL,14,Fnotice a quieter, more comfortable
OL,15,Fenvironment on board, much of the
OL,16,Ftransformation has happened behind the
OL,17,Fscenes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FBosses say the Royal Daffodil will use
OL,7,F"highly manoeuvrable propulsion
OL,8,Fsystems", giving crews greater control
OL,9,Fof the ferry.
OL,11,FMarine Operations Manager Ian Hayman,
OL,12,Fwho has spent a decade working on the
OL,13,Fproject, said. "This is a completely
OL,14,Fdifferent vessel to what we've
OL,15,Foperated before.
OL,17,F"It's more responsive, more modern and
OL,18,Fgives us opportunities to deliver an
OL,19,Feven better experience for passengers.
OL,20,FBut bringing a vessel like this into
OL,21,Fservice is a huge team effort.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FDawang Haruna trained in Nigeria and
OL,7,Fafter spending more than a decade at
OL,8,Fsea, he moved to the UK and joined
OL,9,FMersey Ferries.
OL,11,FHe said, "Very few engineers get the
OL,12,Fchance to be involved with a brand-new
OL,13,Fvessel from construction through to
OL,14,Fcommissioning and into service. It's a
OL,15,Fonce-in-a-career opportunity and I'm
OL,16,Fvery proud to be part of that story.
OL,18,F"We call ourselves a crew because
OL,19,Feverybody plays a vital role. Just
OL,20,Flike a football team, everybody
OL,21,Fdepends on everybody else."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
