FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FDeckhand Phil Rogers added, "The best
OL,7,Fthing about working at Mersey Ferries
OL,8,Fis the sense of togetherness. Whether
OL,9,Fyou're on deck, in the engine room or
OL,10,Fon the bridge, everybody works
OL,11,Ftogether and everybody plays a part."
OL,13,FMarine Customer Service Officer Katey
OL,14,FHutchinson is among the newest members
OL,15,Fof the Mersey Ferries team and has
OL,16,Fbeen helping prepare Royal Daffodil
OL,17,Ffor service while learning the skills
OL,18,Fneeded to operate on board.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FAfter spending more than a decade
OL,7,Fworking in the international yachting
OL,8,Findustry, Katey returned home to the
OL,9,FLiverpool City Region and joined
OL,10,FMersey Ferries earlier this year.
OL,12,F"For me, working on the Mersey Ferries
OL,13,Fcombines two things I've always loved,
OL,14,Fbeing on the water and meeting people.
OL,16,F"Every day is different, whether we're
OL,17,Fcarrying commuters, welcoming visitors
OL,18,Ffrom around the world or helping
OL,19,Ffamilies enjoy a day out on the river."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
