PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786126701
OL,3,CMeet the crew on board Liverpool's
OL,4,Cbrand new Mersey Ferry
OL,6,FPainted in Mersey Ferries' traditional
OL,7,Fcolours of red, white and black, the
OL,8,FRoyal Daffodil will feature a
OL,9,Fcontemporary main-deck lounge, modern
OL,10,Fbars and spacious open-plan decks.
OL,12,FThe vessel can also become a venue for
OL,13,Fconferences, corporate functions and
OL,14,Fprivate celebrations on Liverpool's
OL,15,Ficonic waterfront.
OL,17,FA dedicated lift will provide access
OL,18,Fto the upper deck to ensure that all
OL,19,Fpassengers can enjoy the ferry's
OL,20,Ffacilities and panoramic views across
OL,21,Fthe River Mersey.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
